{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An equilateral triangle whose side is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is divided into a triangle and a trapezoid by a line drawn parallel to one of its sides. If the area of the trapezoid equals one-half of the area of the original triangle, the length of the median of the trapezoid is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/4/7d40b066193866bd4ed98a2cd4eb80203ff3be65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\sqrt{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2+\\sqrt{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{2+\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{2\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{6}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"553\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of the large equilateral triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/5680cf41c65db6e3f80ed6cf491eb9a1915a74c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2*\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}=\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"41\" /> square units, so the smaller triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/9/4e9191a5007067cff8f6d73f4d3419e08238f00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"26\" height=\"41\" />. The side length of the smaller length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/c/f4cbde92ed3cd5f22f0e4e551dafc1117e42b0da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3}}*\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} = \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"140\" height=\"53\" />. The median of the trapezoid can be determined by the average of the two bases of the trapezoids, so it works out to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/c/b7cb23671d99dbee956bb1cf63b736d06e460304.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\frac{2+\\sqrt{2}}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"100\" height=\"53\" /> units long.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Go back to the rest of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">1955 AHSME Problems</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017161546\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 335/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1523/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.048      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n100.00%    5.048      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20045:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017161546 and revision id 291041. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}